  "fullPrintedRows":[
    {"id":"73-r01","kind":"formula-with-leading-prose","text":"或 U_<m-shape>^2 = I_<m-shape>^2 [R^2 + (omega L - 1/(omega C))^2]"},
    {"id":"73-r02","kind":"prose","text":"从等式（2.34）中可以很容易地求出电路中电流强度的"},
    {"id":"73-r03","kind":"prose","text":"振幅："},
    {"id":"73-r04","kind":"formula","text":"I_<m-shape> = U_<m-shape>/sqrt(R^2 + (omega L - 1/(omega C))^2)","number":"2.39"},
    {"id":"73-r05","kind":"prose","text":"这样，由于电路各段上的电压间的相位差，得出图43中表示"},
    {"id":"73-r06","kind":"prose","text":"的电路的总阻抗 Z："},
    {"id":"73-r07","kind":"formula","text":"Z = sqrt(R^2 + (omega L - 1/(omega C))^2)","number":"2.40"},
    {"id":"73-r08","kind":"prose","text":"从电流强度和电压的振幅可以导出这些量的有效值，它"},
    {"id":"73-r09","kind":"prose","text":"们相互之间的关系和公式（2.39）中的振幅关系是完全一"},
    {"id":"73-r10","kind":"prose","text":"样的："},
    {"id":"73-r11","kind":"formula","text":"I = U/sqrt(R^2 + (omega L - 1/(omega C))^2)","number":"2.41"},
    {"id":"73-r12","kind":"prose","text":"这就是图43所示的交流电路的欧姆定律。电流强度的瞬"},
    {"id":"73-r13","kind":"prose","text":"时值随时间简谐变化："},
    {"id":"73-r14","kind":"formula","text":"i = I_<m-shape> cos(omega t + phi)","number":"2.42"},
    {"id":"73-r15","kind":"prose","text":"这里 phi 是线路中电流强度和电压之间的相位差，它和角"},
    {"id":"73-r16","kind":"prose","text":"频率 omega 及电路的参数 R、L、C 有关。"},
    {"id":"73-r17","kind":"title","text":"27. 交流电路中的功率"},
    {"id":"73-r18","kind":"prose","text":"在所有情况下，稳恒电流电路上的功率由电流强度和电"},
    {"id":"73-r19","kind":"prose","text":"压的乘积来确定："},
    {"id":"73-r20","kind":"formula","text":"P = UI","number":"2.43"}
  ],
